    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Potion, Rare</em></p><p>A squat stoneware flask, stoppered with wax and warm to the palm the way the shard is warm. Hesper brews it for the ones she is keeping: a body that has been drunk from does not hold together well enough to be worth turning, so she gives it back what was taken, and begins again.</p><p><strong>When you drink this potion, you regain ALL hit-point maximum you have lost</strong> — every point shaved off by Life Drain or any similar effect is restored at once. You also regain 4d4 + 4 hit points.</p><p><em>There is exactly one of these in the Hollow. It will not be here twice.</em></p>",
